    given-names: "Ankur Kumar"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-22
repository-code: "https://github.com/rjraunak04/nfhs5-anaemia-severity-ml"
url: "https://github.com/rjraunak04/nfhs5-anaemia-severity-ml"
abstract: >-
  Survey-aware, leakage-resistant machine-learning research pipeline for
  four-class anaemia severity classification among women aged 15-49 using
  NFHS-5 India. This development release includes aggregate development and
  calibration reporting but does not report locked-test performance.
keywords:
  - anaemia
  - NFHS-5
  - machine learning
  - survey data
  - multiclass classification
  - calibration
